      "role_description": "Clears Heat and dries Dampness, drains Fire (especially Heart Fire), and resolves toxicity. As the added herb that distinguishes this formula from Wen Dan Tang, it powerfully clears the Heat component of Phlegm-Heat, calms the mind, and stops irritability."
